From ce95d3d63248a16473a03d3cf86b25d6e851ad0b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:19:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Three tunes switched by a button or by the app
 (pro-style ajustes)

Tune 1 is the main tables. Tunes 2 and 3 (config->extraTunes) each have their own
injection time (ms), VE, ignition, target lambda and boost tables on the main axes.
A button cycles through tuneCount tunes and writing activeTune picks one, also with the
engine running. A tune with an empty fuel or lambda table is never selected.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
